    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Increment 2: `rustev`, a command-line host over the library. Plan check, compile and show against descriptor, rules-program, calibration and execution-policy files; run one snapshot through `rustev-runtime` on rules-program backends with a file evidence sink and optional bounded capture into a replay bundle; offline replay under an explicitly supplied trusted scope; evaluation reports with their detail and configuration companions, regression gates, and temperature fitting with its lineage record, through `rustev-eval`. Bounded file access, stable JSON output and distinct exit codes. No network, no hosting, no live inference beyond the deterministic rules backend.\n",
